Also note: the TransientError check — the spec says "it may fail with an error of type TransientError." The test returns `TransientError{errors.New("some error")}` directly (not wrapped). errors.As works with direct types too. Good.

Also, the defrobTag field is unexported, but since it's the same package, it's accessible.

